<TITLE>Integrated Antenna</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>An integrated antenna is available as a factory option on all models. The integrated antenna combines the "GPS antenna" and "ETC antenna", saving installation space and improving reception performance. The antenna is installed behind the center of the instrument panel.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
